data_PbTe_rocksalt_primitive
# PbTe rocksalt 2-atom primitive cell (Fm-3m, space group 225).
# Conventional lattice parameter a_conv = 6.4540 Å (room T experimental).
# Primitive cell: rhombohedral with FCC translations.
#   Pb at (0,0,0); Te at (1/2,1/2,1/2) of primitive cell.
# Mid-temperature (~700 K) thermoelectric reference (ZT ~1.5 with proper
# nanostructuring); used as the L1.5 thermoelectric sidecar fixture.
#
# Sources:
#   - Wyckoff, R. W. G. "Crystal Structures Vol. 1", 2nd ed., 1963.
#   - Pei, Y. et al. "Convergence of electronic bands for high performance
#     bulk thermoelectrics", Nature 473, 66–69 (2011).
#     DOI: 10.1038/nature09996
#   - Materials Project entry mp-19717 (PbTe).
_cell_length_a 4.563570
_cell_length_b 4.563570
_cell_length_c 4.563570
_cell_angle_alpha 60.0
_cell_angle_beta 60.0
_cell_angle_gamma 60.0
_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M 'P 1'
_symmetry_Int_Tables_number 1
loop_
_atom_site_type_symbol
_atom_site_fract_x
_atom_site_fract_y
_atom_site_fract_z
